        "original_id": "c145cf5c-576c-58ca-88f9-958aab1fc310",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Louis Zamperini, Spencer Lofranco\n- Films: Unbroken, Dixieland\n- Roles: Harry Brooks\n- Topics: World War II, Olympic running, Christian evangelism\n\nFacts:\n- Louis Zamperini was born on January 26, 1917, and died on July 2, 2014.\n- Louis Zamperini was an Olympic distance runner, a World War II US prisoner of war survivor, and a Christian evangelist.\n- The film Unbroken revolves around the life of USA Olympian and army officer Louis \"Louie\" Zamperini.\n- Spencer Lofranco co-starred as Harry Brooks in the biographical war drama Unbroken in 2014.\n- Spencer Lofranco played Billy in the crime drama Dixieland in 2015.",
